WEBVTT

01:49.580 --> 01:54.940
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.009 --> 01:57.940
[Episode 25]

01:58.020 --> 01:59.979
[Yongde Gate]

01:58.590 --> 01:59.430
General Chu,

02:00.640 --> 02:01.950
don't you want to wipe out the entire

02:01.950 --> 02:03.280
Waning River Crescent?

02:03.760 --> 02:05.000
I suggest you carefully consider

02:05.000 --> 02:06.810
if you have what it takes.

02:07.310 --> 02:09.470
Phantom dragon lurks in the black market.

02:09.470 --> 02:12.200
Radiant lanterns
illuminate the Nightwalkers.

02:12.390 --> 02:15.170
♪ Phantom dragon
lurks in the black market ♪

02:14.430 --> 02:16.000
We're Nightwalkers.

02:16.000 --> 02:17.680
Greetings, officers.

02:16.900 --> 02:19.570
♪ Radiant lanterns
illuminate the Nightwalkers ♪

02:21.510 --> 02:23.470
We're Nightwalkers of
the Waning River Crescent.

02:21.740 --> 02:23.490
♪ I ride on the wind
of the waning river crescent ♪

02:23.590 --> 02:25.380
Greetings, officers.

02:24.360 --> 02:26.190
♪ Hate the injustice in the world ♪

02:26.900 --> 02:28.640
♪ Loyalty and righteousness
weigh on both sides of the scale ♪

02:29.270 --> 02:31.690
♪ Wield the knife
to carve a rift in the hell ♪

02:30.520 --> 02:31.660
Guys,

02:32.040 --> 02:34.770
I was ready to visit the nether world.

02:35.130 --> 02:36.680
Why are you doing this?

02:37.130 --> 02:38.079
♪ The waning river crescent sheds light
over the old chess board ♪

02:37.280 --> 02:38.560
Is it some kind of death wish?

02:38.560 --> 02:39.390
♪ On the 32 sandalwood tables ♪

02:39.310 --> 02:40.329
Second Master,

02:39.680 --> 02:40.690
♪ The gamblers toss their bucks ♪

02:40.840 --> 02:43.160
have you forgotten
the Nightwalkers' rules?

02:41.130 --> 02:42.010
♪ Beneath the dice cup
hide secret letters ♪

02:42.260 --> 02:43.360
♪ The storyteller unfolds the story ♪

02:43.430 --> 02:44.680
We share drinks

02:43.620 --> 02:44.720
♪ The code is in the 13th line ♪

02:44.680 --> 02:46.010
and meat together.

02:45.000 --> 02:45.970
♪ I dip cold tea to write spy info ♪

02:46.190 --> 02:47.680
If you are to visit the nether world,

02:46.290 --> 02:47.250
♪ The ink seeps into the board ♪

02:47.800 --> 02:49.900
do take us with you!

02:47.810 --> 02:49.650
♪ The pawnshop owner weeps,
counting silver notes ♪

02:49.980 --> 02:50.850
-That's right!
-That's right!

02:50.240 --> 02:52.620
♪ The pledged military order
is now riddled with decay ♪

02:53.390 --> 02:55.310
♪ A wine banner
pierces the midnight haze ♪

02:55.990 --> 02:57.970
♪ A secret stronghold
lies dormant on the canal map ♪

02:56.630 --> 02:57.790
General Chu,

02:58.360 --> 02:59.870
take a good look.

03:00.350 --> 03:02.610
These brothers of mine don't fear death.

03:03.080 --> 03:04.940
I don't think you can defeat them.

03:10.630 --> 03:12.030
Qianyu Army, attention!

03:12.630 --> 03:15.430
The Nightwalkers are openly
storming the execution ground.

03:15.430 --> 03:16.630
Kill them right here.

03:17.000 --> 03:18.240
Spare no one!

03:19.630 --> 03:20.490
How dare you?

03:20.590 --> 03:21.400
Xuanjia Army,

03:21.400 --> 03:22.380
stop them!

03:27.520 --> 03:28.310
Wait!

03:35.710 --> 03:36.520
Yimeng,

03:36.680 --> 03:37.470
what are you doing here?

03:37.470 --> 03:38.400
This is the execution ground.

03:38.400 --> 03:39.770
You shouldn't be here.

03:40.190 --> 03:41.590
We have to, before the finale

03:41.590 --> 03:43.310
comes ahead of schedule.

03:43.560 --> 03:46.280
The premium access to new
episodes is yet to be opened.

03:46.280 --> 03:47.470
Mr. Chu, don't you assert

03:47.470 --> 03:50.400
that Shangguan He is
the chief offender of the theft?

03:50.770 --> 03:52.770
Have you thoroughly investigated

03:52.800 --> 03:55.340
this case that happened three years ago?

03:55.960 --> 03:57.890
Do you know why Mr. Shangguan stole

03:57.920 --> 03:59.829
those disaster relief funds?

04:00.830 --> 04:02.290
When I took over this case,

04:02.300 --> 04:03.910
all the relevant files kept by

04:03.910 --> 04:05.470
the Secretariat had all been destroyed.

04:05.470 --> 04:07.650
Except for the conclusive statement
written by the Ministry of Justice,

04:07.650 --> 04:08.630
no records were left.

04:08.630 --> 04:08.840
So...

04:08.840 --> 04:10.760
So you didn't conduct an investigation.

04:10.760 --> 04:12.200
Mr. Chu, you claim to be

04:12.220 --> 04:13.810
upright and just,

04:13.940 --> 04:15.680
but you're actually a hypocrite

04:15.680 --> 04:17.279
who frames innocent people.

04:19.480 --> 04:20.740
What nonsense is that?

04:20.870 --> 04:22.730
How dare you slander General Chu!

04:22.850 --> 04:23.680
Slander?

04:25.070 --> 04:26.390
Last night, Yimeng and I,

04:26.390 --> 04:28.320
together with Yunlong and Shanhu,

04:28.360 --> 04:30.000
spent just one night

04:30.310 --> 04:32.040
to figure out what Shangguan He

04:32.110 --> 04:34.300
was really like three years ago.

04:35.070 --> 04:36.390
Qianyu Army could've

04:36.510 --> 04:39.050
discovered the truth
with innumerable means,

04:39.050 --> 04:40.870
but you chose to convict and arrest

04:40.870 --> 04:42.000
an innocent person.

04:42.270 --> 04:43.480
You're crooked in nature.

04:43.480 --> 04:45.130
How are you able to serve justice?

04:45.130 --> 04:46.070
How dare you!

04:46.070 --> 04:46.680
Guards!

04:46.680 --> 04:47.740
What are you doing?

04:48.630 --> 04:50.560
All the capital citizens are
watching. Are you going to

04:50.560 --> 04:51.310
strike a woman?

04:51.310 --> 04:52.120
Shut up!

04:52.830 --> 04:54.560
Are you in any position to chime in?

04:54.560 --> 04:55.960
To protect your friends,

04:56.070 --> 04:56.830
you concealed the truth

04:56.830 --> 04:58.190
and obstructed justice.

04:58.190 --> 04:59.659
People like you might be

05:00.360 --> 05:01.720
spared from death penalty,

05:01.720 --> 05:04.180
but certainly not
a hundred times of caning.

05:06.640 --> 05:07.200
Yiting.

05:09.090 --> 05:09.820
[Petition filed by 800 citizens
in Jiangnan Province]

05:12.850 --> 05:13.670
Mr. Chu,

05:14.070 --> 05:15.400
take a good look at this.

05:15.520 --> 05:18.360
[Petition filed by 800 citizens
in Jiangnan Province]

05:15.770 --> 05:16.950
This is a

05:17.070 --> 05:18.430
petition letter,

05:19.830 --> 05:21.240
signed by

05:21.240 --> 05:22.390
over 800 citizens.

05:22.580 --> 05:27.200
[Petition filed by 800 citizens
in Jiangnan Province]

05:22.830 --> 05:23.680
They are

05:24.160 --> 05:25.360
the Jiangnan citizens

05:25.360 --> 05:27.560
helped by Shangguan He three years ago.

05:28.390 --> 05:29.680
They filed a petition to ask
the capital prefecture's office

05:29.680 --> 05:31.270
to distinguish right from wrong

05:31.270 --> 05:32.870
and to spare their lifesaver

05:32.950 --> 05:34.550
from an wrongful execution.

05:35.050 --> 05:36.270
What on earth

05:36.290 --> 05:37.780
happened three years ago?

05:40.130 --> 05:41.950
I bet the Seventh Prince

05:42.390 --> 05:44.230
and Chancellor Gao

05:44.830 --> 05:45.800
have

05:47.570 --> 05:48.740
the answer.

05:54.000 --> 05:56.750
When Jiangnan Province
was struck by floods three years ago,

05:56.750 --> 05:58.110
many citizens there

05:58.360 --> 05:59.430
starved to death.

05:59.840 --> 06:01.870
But the court's disaster relief funds

06:00.650 --> 06:02.270
[Tea House]

06:02.120 --> 06:03.950
never reached the people.

06:06.000 --> 06:09.270
Shangguan Baihe snuck into
the governor's residence,

06:09.350 --> 06:11.990
and discovered the funds
had all been embezzled.

06:11.990 --> 06:13.350
He stole the money

06:13.420 --> 06:14.800
and helped the poor with it.

06:14.800 --> 06:16.190
Outside Jiangnan Province,

06:16.190 --> 06:19.850
he met the Seventh Prince,
who was there to investigate the theft.

06:23.360 --> 06:25.390
Out of concern for the floods,

06:25.490 --> 06:27.340
His Highness arrested Shanghuan He

06:27.340 --> 06:29.100
before learning about the details.

06:29.100 --> 06:30.360
Put your fingerprint on it.

06:30.360 --> 06:32.460
Seeing their hero become

06:32.680 --> 06:34.659
a criminal overnight,

06:34.830 --> 06:36.159
the locals filed a petition for him.

06:36.159 --> 06:36.530
Stay!

06:36.560 --> 06:37.730
The governor was intact

06:37.730 --> 06:39.830
since he was supported
by a powerful official,

06:39.830 --> 06:40.830
whereas

06:40.850 --> 06:43.909
Shangguan He was
thrown into Jiangnan prison.

06:45.230 --> 06:52.370
[Yin]

06:47.680 --> 06:48.950
This token

06:49.159 --> 06:50.680
was found by the Nightwalkers

06:50.680 --> 06:53.210
in the then governor's
residence last night.

06:53.360 --> 06:54.750
"Yin" is engraved on it.

06:55.070 --> 06:56.750
The then governor of Jiangnan Province

06:56.750 --> 06:59.270
[Yin]

06:57.680 --> 06:59.409
was Chancellor Gao's protege.

07:00.450 --> 07:02.320
If the embezzlement was instructed

07:02.320 --> 07:03.810
by Chancellor Gao,

07:04.520 --> 07:09.930
[Yin]

07:04.870 --> 07:07.830
then the Seventh Prince
did have an untellable reason

07:07.830 --> 07:10.070
to secretly release Shangguan He.

07:13.190 --> 07:14.840
Nonsense!

07:15.830 --> 07:16.630
Stop yapping.

07:18.120 --> 07:18.920
Chu Guihong,

07:21.870 --> 07:23.480
you should investigate

07:23.560 --> 07:24.480
the Gao family

07:24.770 --> 07:26.630
and Chancellor Gao's followers,

07:26.950 --> 07:28.480
instead of going after Shangguan He

07:28.480 --> 07:29.830
and the Nightwalkers.

07:31.830 --> 07:33.760
You've been fighting Xuanjia Army

07:33.790 --> 07:35.610
for personal vendettas.

07:35.830 --> 07:36.750
What you're doing

07:36.750 --> 07:39.550
will only destabilize
the Great Jing government.

07:45.750 --> 07:47.480
The theft in Jiangnan Province

07:47.630 --> 07:49.330
was handled by me in person.

07:49.680 --> 07:52.540
Today, I'm overseeing
the execution in person too.

07:52.870 --> 07:54.680
People will still have doubts

07:55.240 --> 07:57.370
until we find out the truth of the case.

07:58.070 --> 07:59.400
However, at this point,

07:59.630 --> 08:01.090
if this strife continues,

08:01.480 --> 08:03.210
the problem will never go away.

08:04.490 --> 08:05.890
Therefore, General Chu,

08:06.270 --> 08:07.190
I suggest

08:07.830 --> 08:09.240
holding all these people

08:09.240 --> 08:10.550
under detention now.

08:10.830 --> 08:13.390
When the Emperor is informed,
and the truth is out,

08:13.390 --> 08:15.190
there will be a final judgement.

08:15.360 --> 08:16.360
What do you think?

08:54.080 --> 08:55.440
Please hear me out, Song Yimeng.

08:55.440 --> 08:57.370
You shouldn't be explaining to me,

08:58.440 --> 09:00.570
but to the Nightwalkers who trust you.

09:04.290 --> 09:05.950
On the eve before this action,

09:06.100 --> 09:07.830
they were still defending you.

09:08.670 --> 09:09.710
Shanhu said

09:10.550 --> 09:12.210
you must have your own reason,

09:12.600 --> 09:14.860
and that you would always be their chief,

09:15.080 --> 09:16.280
no matter who you are,

09:17.640 --> 09:19.440
since you had saved their lives.

09:23.840 --> 09:26.100
Treating others' care for you as nothing

09:26.520 --> 09:27.920
is what you enjoy doing,

09:29.000 --> 09:30.080
isn't it?

09:33.610 --> 09:34.720
I did betray their trust...

09:34.720 --> 09:35.920
The truth of the theft three years ago

09:35.920 --> 09:37.480
is perhaps unknown to

09:37.600 --> 09:39.040
Chu Guihong and the Emperor.

09:39.040 --> 09:40.100
But what about you?

09:41.200 --> 09:42.930
Can you deny knowing the truth?

09:47.080 --> 09:48.030
I do know it.

09:55.480 --> 09:57.740
You'd rather endanger the Nightwalkers

09:57.840 --> 09:59.270
than explore the option

09:59.390 --> 10:01.360
of bringing Gao Changyin to justice

10:01.360 --> 10:03.560
or presenting the truth to the Emperor.

10:04.600 --> 10:06.730
Chu Guihong says
you have a wicked soul

10:06.910 --> 10:08.440
and diabolical ambitions.

10:09.480 --> 10:10.960
Is he really wrong?

10:16.480 --> 10:18.540
You've asked many times for my trust.

10:19.340 --> 10:21.200
But what should I trust about you?

10:28.200 --> 10:29.820
Many of the Nightwalkers

10:30.340 --> 10:32.900
are victims of Gao Changyin's crimes.

10:33.670 --> 10:34.480
And you...

10:35.550 --> 10:37.170
On one hand, you're the Seventh Prince,

10:37.170 --> 10:38.810
harming innocent people.

10:39.480 --> 10:41.480
On the other hand, you're Li Shiliu,

10:41.790 --> 10:43.650
making amends for your mistakes.

10:43.790 --> 10:44.720
You know what?

10:45.220 --> 10:46.680
This is called hypocrisy.

10:49.150 --> 10:51.270
I just want them to have a home.

10:51.360 --> 10:52.200
I can even let them...

10:52.200 --> 10:52.960
Stop it.

10:54.480 --> 10:55.240
Nan Heng,

10:56.150 --> 10:57.600
don't even bother.

10:57.840 --> 11:00.240
Just be the high and mighty
Seventh Prince.

11:02.030 --> 11:03.440
I can't speak for others,

11:04.240 --> 11:07.370
but I just want to remember
the kind and righteous Mr. Li,

11:07.480 --> 11:08.930
instead of you,

11:10.270 --> 11:11.670
an unscrupulous person.

11:33.790 --> 11:36.560
Take all those who attempted
to rescue the criminal

11:36.560 --> 11:38.320
to the capital prefecture's prison!

11:38.320 --> 11:39.050
-Yes!
-Yes!

11:40.750 --> 11:42.360
It was the Seventh Prince

11:42.360 --> 11:44.030
who ordered to hold us in detention.

11:44.030 --> 11:45.790
We should be brought to his place.

11:45.790 --> 11:47.030
Who are you to make decisions?

11:47.030 --> 11:48.290
What kind of gibberish...

11:48.290 --> 11:49.140
Enough, guys.

11:49.870 --> 11:50.870
Listen,

11:51.210 --> 11:52.900
we're all familiar with each other.

11:52.900 --> 11:55.120
It's unnecessary to create tension.

11:55.680 --> 11:56.480
Otherwise...

11:56.510 --> 11:57.870
You're on death row.

11:58.390 --> 12:00.480
Who are you to tell me what to do?

12:02.960 --> 12:04.390
Do you think

12:05.400 --> 12:07.000
you can stop all of us?

12:07.030 --> 12:08.240
I was looking for a reason to fight.

12:08.240 --> 12:09.480
Come at me, I dare you!

12:09.480 --> 12:10.270
Hold on.

12:20.870 --> 12:22.270
You guys go with Rong Hua

12:22.870 --> 12:24.000
to the capital prefecture's office.

12:24.000 --> 12:24.790
Chief...

12:27.510 --> 12:28.370
Your Highness.

12:30.970 --> 12:32.370
What are you trying to do?

12:35.350 --> 12:37.260
It's time to set things right.

12:38.360 --> 12:40.220
What Song Yimeng said is correct.

12:40.750 --> 12:43.480
I shouldn't treat others' care
for me as nothing.

12:45.980 --> 12:47.240
All the Nightwalkers'

12:47.270 --> 12:48.150
doings are morally

12:48.150 --> 12:48.960
justifiable.

12:49.600 --> 12:51.660
You shouldn't be lurking in the dark.

12:53.300 --> 12:55.960
I'm sorry to have
reduced you to this situation.

12:59.660 --> 13:01.270
Where is this coming from?

13:01.890 --> 13:03.350
What exactly is your plan?

13:06.080 --> 13:07.630
Go and tell Chu Guihong

13:07.660 --> 13:09.030
that the target he has been after

13:09.030 --> 13:10.120
is me alone.

13:10.960 --> 13:12.200
If he wants a fight,

13:12.770 --> 13:14.200
then bring it on

13:14.200 --> 13:15.840
in the imperial court.

13:17.730 --> 13:20.020
I'll let my people go with you today.

13:20.630 --> 13:22.870
But if they ever get hurt,

13:23.480 --> 13:24.870
I'll have Chu Guihong

13:25.330 --> 13:26.570
pay a steep price.

13:35.000 --> 13:35.790
Yes,

13:36.150 --> 13:37.380
Your Highness.

13:38.640 --> 13:40.090
Take them away!

13:40.110 --> 13:43.200
[Yongde Gate]

13:40.480 --> 13:41.270
-Yes!
-Yes!

13:44.240 --> 13:45.030
Come with us.

13:54.550 --> 13:55.410
Your Highness,

13:55.630 --> 13:57.530
Chu Guihong has set out for the palace.

13:57.530 --> 13:59.150
He'll complain about you to the Emperor.

13:59.150 --> 14:00.470
Shall we set off too?

14:01.870 --> 14:02.730
No need to rush.

14:04.200 --> 14:05.630
I have a task for you.

14:08.510 --> 14:09.730
Shanhu said

14:08.600 --> 14:11.460
♪ No words can cage
a heart full of wounds ♪

14:10.480 --> 14:12.140
you must have your own reason,

14:12.200 --> 14:14.580
♪ I shake the heavens and plains
through the storm ♪

14:12.270 --> 14:13.080
Chief,

14:13.080 --> 14:13.910
I know...

14:13.930 --> 14:15.590
and that no matter who you are,

14:15.610 --> 14:18.820
♪ A promise is made,
and I don't fear death anymore ♪

14:16.030 --> 14:18.060
you would always be their chief.

14:19.330 --> 14:20.390
The Nightwalker

14:19.830 --> 14:22.270
♪ Even dreams are pleasant ♪

14:20.670 --> 14:22.030
will no longer be our home

14:22.030 --> 14:22.910
without you.

14:23.390 --> 14:25.000
True brothers live

14:25.150 --> 14:26.270
and die together.

14:26.790 --> 14:28.440
We're Nightwalkers.

14:28.480 --> 14:30.470
Greetings, officers.

14:31.870 --> 14:33.160
Calm, Your Highness.

14:34.030 --> 14:35.860
I'll atone for my mistakes

14:36.440 --> 14:37.840
after my one last drink.

14:38.240 --> 14:40.980
♪ Beyond my control, powerless to resist ♪

14:40.440 --> 14:41.960
On one hand, you're the Seventh Prince,

14:41.820 --> 14:44.250
♪ Yet still I dig deep, questioning fate ♪

14:41.980 --> 14:43.790
harming innocent people.

14:44.390 --> 14:46.150
On the other hand, you're Li Shiliu,

14:45.420 --> 14:48.610
♪ That is the meaning behind my defiance ♪

14:46.450 --> 14:48.320
making amends for your mistakes.

14:48.600 --> 14:49.440
You know what?

14:49.960 --> 14:51.420
This is called hypocrisy.

14:51.810 --> 14:53.170
I can't speak for others,

14:52.350 --> 14:54.800
♪ Even doomed for eternity,
I still have the courage ♪

14:53.970 --> 14:56.370
but I just want to remember
the righteous and kind Mr. Li,

14:55.750 --> 14:58.130
♪ For you, I'd step into the uncertainty ♪

14:57.360 --> 14:58.630
instead of you,

14:59.170 --> 15:02.490
♪ If you believe in fate ♪

14:59.880 --> 15:01.280
an unscrupulous person.

15:04.380 --> 15:06.760
♪ No words can cage
a heart full of wounds ♪

15:07.930 --> 15:10.180
♪ I shake the heavens and plains
through the storm ♪

15:11.280 --> 15:14.680
♪ A promise is made,
and I don't fear death anymore ♪

15:15.600 --> 15:17.290
♪ Even dreams are pleasant ♪

15:18.300 --> 15:20.850
♪ Is it obsession, or chosen pain? ♪

15:21.890 --> 15:26.010
♪ Is it pride, with no shame? ♪

15:26.720 --> 15:30.240
♪ To give you a love
etched into the bones ♪

15:31.330 --> 15:34.350
♪ Then it's not something to grieve over ♪

15:37.620 --> 15:46.860
[Yongde Gate]

15:56.380 --> 15:57.450
Song!

15:57.670 --> 15:58.480
Song!

15:59.260 --> 16:03.160
[Minister of Justice]
[Yan Yi]

16:01.360 --> 16:02.150
I heard

16:02.960 --> 16:05.020
Gao's mansion was seized yesterday.

16:05.480 --> 16:06.790
There were Qianyu soldiers
coming and going

16:06.790 --> 16:08.870
in the chancellor's house
till after midnight.

16:08.870 --> 16:10.000
Early this morning,

16:10.480 --> 16:12.610
the streets were even under lockdown.

16:13.020 --> 16:14.230
Is the Emperor going

16:15.090 --> 16:16.720
to make a big move?

16:17.800 --> 16:20.030
Don't venture guesses
on the Emperor's intentions.

16:20.030 --> 16:20.750
Go in the court,

16:20.750 --> 16:22.610
and we'll know what's happening.

16:23.480 --> 16:25.360
Of course you don't worry
at all, Minister of War.

16:25.360 --> 16:27.160
But I'm the Minister of Justice.

16:28.870 --> 16:29.480
It was

16:29.500 --> 16:32.600
my ministry that concluded
the theft in Jiangnan Province.

16:32.600 --> 16:33.870
I'll be the first one to blame

16:33.870 --> 16:36.070
if the Emperor is to hold anyone liable!

16:38.480 --> 16:39.510
Song.

16:40.790 --> 16:42.980
We passed the imperial exam together.

16:43.150 --> 16:44.650
You must help me.

16:47.480 --> 16:49.870
Your ministry did the case
according to the rules.

16:49.870 --> 16:51.720
You're not connected to the Gao family.

16:51.720 --> 16:53.300
Don't act like you're guilty.

16:53.300 --> 16:54.280
Besides,

16:54.520 --> 16:55.880
many scholars passed
the exam at the same time.

16:55.880 --> 16:57.280
We had different tutors.

16:57.480 --> 16:58.270
It's not like we're close.

16:58.270 --> 16:59.530
Please leave me alone.

16:59.600 --> 17:00.660
Mr. Wang!

17:02.000 --> 17:04.030
But I am involved in this mess now.

17:04.440 --> 17:05.069
Song!

17:05.160 --> 17:06.010
Song!

17:33.770 --> 17:35.250
Where is Heng?

17:36.480 --> 17:39.330
Is this what he wants,
to let everyone wait for him?

17:41.240 --> 17:42.170
An old case

17:42.350 --> 17:43.940
in Jiangnan Province has unexpectedly

17:43.940 --> 17:47.270
embroiled so many followers
and associates of the Gao family.

17:47.270 --> 17:48.680
Heng is involved in it,

17:48.680 --> 17:49.940
yet he hasn't shown up.

17:49.940 --> 17:51.670
I'm afraid he has fled to escape

17:51.830 --> 17:53.550
punishment, knowing that Father

17:53.550 --> 17:55.080
will hold him accountable.

17:55.440 --> 17:56.310
Father,

17:56.480 --> 17:57.680
I advise you to immediately

17:57.680 --> 17:58.680
order to search and seize

17:58.680 --> 18:00.070
the residences of all the officials

18:00.070 --> 18:01.460
connected to the Gao family,

18:01.460 --> 18:02.960
and to let Guihong bring them to

18:02.960 --> 18:05.480
the capital prefecture's
prison for interrogations.

18:05.480 --> 18:06.240
Also,

18:06.240 --> 18:07.680
the power to command Xuanjia Army

18:07.680 --> 18:10.440
should be instantly taken from Nan Heng.

18:13.330 --> 18:14.330
Song Yude,

18:14.880 --> 18:17.410
what do you think of Rui's suggestion?

18:21.270 --> 18:22.310
Your Majesty,

18:23.790 --> 18:27.510
Xuanjia Army was established
by the Seventh Prince.

18:27.600 --> 18:28.850
But it is my belief

18:29.060 --> 18:32.940
that all the military power should
rest in Your Majesty's hands.

18:34.520 --> 18:36.510
That said, a legitimate reason

18:39.880 --> 18:42.760
is needed to take
the Seventh Prince's power away.

18:43.220 --> 18:44.510
Mr. Song,

18:44.880 --> 18:46.240
in just one day,

18:46.240 --> 18:48.200
news about Chancellor Gao's
illegal acts in the theft case

18:48.200 --> 18:50.460
has reached every corner in the capital.

18:50.780 --> 18:52.010
Eighteenth Prince,

18:52.830 --> 18:54.420
hearsay on the streets

18:54.440 --> 18:55.410
is called rumor.

18:55.930 --> 18:57.110
Witnesses

18:57.110 --> 18:58.350
or physical evidence

18:58.490 --> 19:00.690
properly examined by local institutes

19:00.940 --> 19:02.290
and reports from
authorities of all levels,

19:02.290 --> 19:03.800
plus a trial conducted
by three judicial offices,

19:03.800 --> 19:05.660
are needed to determine the charges

19:05.660 --> 19:07.920
and punishment for an alleged offender.

19:13.610 --> 19:14.790
The reopening of an old case

19:14.790 --> 19:16.880
means the start of an arduous process.

19:16.880 --> 19:19.810
What if the Seventh Prince
takes action before we do?

19:21.310 --> 19:22.110
Your Majesty,

19:22.500 --> 19:23.640
yesterday's incident
on the execution ground

19:23.640 --> 19:25.300
already unraveled the truth.

19:25.310 --> 19:26.400
The Seventh Prince Nan Heng

19:26.400 --> 19:28.160
is not only the leader of
Chancellor Gao's faction

19:28.160 --> 19:29.270
and the commander of a strong army,

19:29.270 --> 19:30.160
but also a powerful figure

19:30.160 --> 19:32.240
in the martial arts world,
ruling the Nightwalkers.

19:32.240 --> 19:33.510
We have to take action

19:34.240 --> 19:36.440
before a mutiny happens in the capital.

19:37.440 --> 19:38.070
Indeed.

19:43.590 --> 19:44.400
Your Majesty,

19:44.510 --> 19:46.400
I agree with General Chu.

19:47.000 --> 19:48.270
I concur.

19:48.410 --> 19:49.770
-I concur.
-I concur.

19:49.960 --> 19:51.070
We all concur.

19:58.640 --> 19:59.860
What a shock to know

20:00.270 --> 20:01.550
that I'm dreaded

20:01.580 --> 20:03.280
by all the officials.

20:14.460 --> 20:15.890
Your Majesty.

20:16.110 --> 20:17.630
How dare you come here?

20:18.030 --> 20:19.440
Any Imperial Guards outside?

20:19.440 --> 20:20.750
He formed cliques and covered

20:20.750 --> 20:22.480
for Chancellor Gao. Take him down!

20:22.480 --> 20:23.280
Your Majesty,

20:24.030 --> 20:25.030
this scroll records

20:25.030 --> 20:27.480
the witnesses and evidence
of the old case in Jiangnan Province.

20:27.480 --> 20:28.750
I have properly dealt with

20:28.750 --> 20:30.270
all the personnel involved.

20:30.270 --> 20:31.270
If there are more,

20:31.440 --> 20:33.370
they can be convicted and arrested

20:33.400 --> 20:35.060
after Minister Yan's review.

20:35.270 --> 20:36.200
Bring it here.

20:39.270 --> 20:41.400
The evidence was destroyed long ago.

20:41.420 --> 20:42.720
How did you get it?

20:43.440 --> 20:44.640
I personally handled

20:45.030 --> 20:46.550
this case three years ago.

20:46.550 --> 20:48.150
I kept the scroll, of course.

20:48.270 --> 20:49.070
I travelled

20:49.330 --> 20:50.480
day and night to retrieve it

20:50.480 --> 20:51.590
with the help of

20:51.590 --> 20:52.720
three fine horses.

20:53.480 --> 20:54.270
You?

20:55.070 --> 20:56.240
You are a suspect.

20:56.510 --> 20:58.570
Who knows if you've tampered with it?

20:58.830 --> 21:00.310
If you have doubts,

21:01.170 --> 21:03.430
then join Minister Yan in the review.

21:03.450 --> 21:04.980
[The Grand Theft in Jiangnan Province]

21:04.140 --> 21:05.800
Making baseless accusations

21:05.880 --> 21:07.000
and badgering me

21:07.270 --> 21:09.510
won't help with the matter.

21:09.510 --> 21:09.960
You...

21:09.960 --> 21:11.030
Heng,

21:11.350 --> 21:12.440
in your opinion,

21:12.880 --> 21:15.640
how should Gao Changyin
be punished for what he did

21:15.640 --> 21:16.840
in this case?

21:18.070 --> 21:18.920
Your Majesty,

21:20.030 --> 21:22.680
Gao Changyin is proven to
have embezzled 2,000 taels of gold

21:22.680 --> 21:24.240
from the disaster relief funds.

21:24.240 --> 21:26.240
Though the money was
recovered three years ago,

21:26.240 --> 21:28.090
he should still be dismissed from

21:28.090 --> 21:30.150
the position of chancellor and exiled

21:30.150 --> 21:32.080
according to the law of Great Jing.

21:32.270 --> 21:33.250
Exile?

21:33.640 --> 21:36.200
The Seventh Prince will lose a strong aide

21:36.220 --> 21:38.960
by exiling Chancellor Gao, won't he?

21:39.440 --> 21:40.390
Yes.

21:42.750 --> 21:44.350
How clever of Your Highness.

21:44.640 --> 21:46.190
You're sacrificing Gao Changyin

21:46.190 --> 21:47.650
just to silence everyone.

21:48.000 --> 21:49.530
General Chu, you are wrong.

21:50.590 --> 21:51.400
Your Majesty,

21:52.030 --> 21:53.750
If it hadn't been for my indulgence,

21:53.750 --> 21:56.610
Gao Changyin wouldn't
have committed such crimes.

21:56.640 --> 21:58.030
Today, I'm not only here

21:58.590 --> 22:00.790
to convict Gao Changyin,

22:01.270 --> 22:02.670
but also to admit my guilt

22:02.750 --> 22:04.350
in Your Majesty's presence.

22:05.240 --> 22:07.000
Are you only guilty of covering

22:07.000 --> 22:08.030
for Gao Changyin?

22:08.440 --> 22:09.240
What about

22:09.790 --> 22:10.880
harboring Shangguan He,

22:10.880 --> 22:12.070
colluding with the Nightwalkers

22:12.070 --> 22:13.240
and doing evil?

22:13.240 --> 22:14.040
Your Majesty,

22:14.590 --> 22:15.880
the Waning River Crescent

22:15.880 --> 22:16.680
was indeed

22:17.140 --> 22:18.310
founded by me.

22:19.440 --> 22:21.440
I'm also the chief of it,

22:22.000 --> 22:23.000
Li Shiliu.

22:24.480 --> 22:27.210
The Seventh Prince is Li Shiliu?

22:33.920 --> 22:34.720
For

22:34.960 --> 22:36.050
failing my supervisory duties

22:36.050 --> 22:37.480
and trusting the wrong person,

22:37.480 --> 22:38.790
I deserve 20 lashes.

22:39.440 --> 22:40.960
For sponsoring people
from the martial arts world

22:40.960 --> 22:42.350
and withholding the truth,

22:42.350 --> 22:43.750
I deserve 20 more lashes.

22:43.880 --> 22:45.000
For indulging outlaws in

22:45.000 --> 22:46.400
storming the execution ground,

22:46.400 --> 22:47.860
I deserve extra 20 lashes.

22:48.480 --> 22:49.270
Now,

22:49.860 --> 22:52.060
I forfeit my royal title to make amends.

22:52.880 --> 22:53.830
From now on,

22:54.440 --> 22:56.700
I will no longer be
a prince of Great Jing.

22:57.030 --> 22:58.350
I will enjoy no privilege

22:58.350 --> 22:59.730
or honor.

22:59.880 --> 23:01.610
I only wish to lead Xuanjia Army

23:01.740 --> 23:04.480
to sustain the peace of Great Jing.

23:05.960 --> 23:07.070
His Highness will

23:07.510 --> 23:10.240
be no different than a commoner, right?

23:10.310 --> 23:13.070
His Highness is withdrawing
from the succession struggle.

23:13.070 --> 23:14.640
Chancellor Gao is in trouble.

23:14.640 --> 23:16.480
The Seventh Prince is
asking for a demotion.

23:16.480 --> 23:19.010
Is His Highness trying
to get himself killed?

23:19.070 --> 23:19.870
Your Majesty,

23:20.100 --> 23:21.680
the Seventh Prince is attempting

23:21.680 --> 23:22.880
to take all the blame.

23:22.880 --> 23:23.400
I implore...

23:23.400 --> 23:24.200
Your Majesty!

23:25.790 --> 23:26.720
Between

23:26.740 --> 23:28.770
the law and the will of a person,

23:28.920 --> 23:31.140
we should follow the former,

23:31.160 --> 23:32.740
not the latter.

23:33.270 --> 23:34.400
It was Gao Changyin

23:34.420 --> 23:36.840
who made missteps in this old case,

23:36.960 --> 23:38.650
not the Seventh Prince.

23:39.000 --> 23:39.930
Moreover,

23:40.370 --> 23:43.170
the prisoner who was supposed
to be executed yesterday

23:43.170 --> 23:44.970
had been wrongfully convicted.

23:45.600 --> 23:48.190
He was kept alive for three years

23:49.240 --> 23:51.520
because of the Seventh Prince's mercy.

23:51.640 --> 23:53.500
As for the Waning River Crescent,

23:53.590 --> 23:55.990
although it is independent from the court,

23:56.220 --> 23:57.900
it has done nothing but

23:57.960 --> 24:00.220
benefit the people over these years.

24:00.480 --> 24:02.210
It hasn't done anything wrong.

24:12.200 --> 24:13.000
Yan Yi,

24:14.000 --> 24:16.330
how should the Seventh Prince be punished

24:16.350 --> 24:19.010
according to the law
of the Ministry of Justice?

24:22.050 --> 24:23.550
Why are you looking at him?

24:24.160 --> 24:25.760
Just give me a candid answer.

24:26.880 --> 24:27.830
Your Majesty,

24:28.400 --> 24:30.600
if everything in the scroll is correct,

24:31.680 --> 24:34.680
then the Seventh Prince
should be punished as he said.

24:35.750 --> 24:38.500
Given the Seventh Prince's
unwavering devotion

24:38.540 --> 24:40.070
to the country, to his uncle,

24:40.070 --> 24:41.640
and to everyone around him,

24:41.920 --> 24:43.400
I hereby grant his wish.

24:43.510 --> 24:45.680
On behalf of Great Jing, I order him to be

24:45.680 --> 24:48.680
lashed 60 times and
stripped of his noble title.

24:53.590 --> 24:54.990
Thank you, Your Majesty.

25:22.060 --> 25:27.560
♪ I leave the book aside,
though I haven't finished reading it ♪

25:31.000 --> 25:36.740
♪ I know one day I can have
a glimpse of the ending ♪

25:37.590 --> 25:40.550
Who would know
the calculating Seventh Prince

25:39.920 --> 25:43.990
♪ Life is unpredictable ♪

25:40.550 --> 25:42.590
actually took take all the blame

25:42.590 --> 25:44.980
for a tiny organization
in the martial arts world?

25:44.980 --> 25:47.800
♪ Who can get rid of perplexity ♪

25:45.200 --> 25:47.000
It's not worth it.

25:47.590 --> 25:50.240
He relinquished his own
power just to exculpate

25:48.770 --> 25:53.510
♪ And find the answer he yearns for? ♪

25:50.240 --> 25:52.700
those nobodies
from the martial arts world.

25:53.160 --> 25:54.810
Who would expect this?

25:54.960 --> 25:57.670
The Emperor is not showing him any mercy.

25:57.510 --> 26:00.660
♪ Let the wind flip through
the past chapters of my life ♪

25:58.640 --> 26:00.830
A man who grew up in the cold palace

26:00.830 --> 26:02.920
through struggling and suffering

26:02.080 --> 26:05.050
♪ Let brush and ink
depict my adventures ♪

26:03.270 --> 26:06.110
would have a heart of stone
and the ferocity of a wolf,

26:06.110 --> 26:07.730
don't you think?

26:06.430 --> 26:13.000
♪ Let's see in how many ways
fate can shape my life ♪

26:09.120 --> 26:12.030
What a waste of my delicacies.

26:15.000 --> 26:17.160
All those sweet words
and tender affection

26:15.510 --> 26:18.770
♪ Let moonlight shine on
the lines about love and hate ♪

26:17.160 --> 26:18.730
that come with romance

26:18.920 --> 26:19.720
are merely

26:19.780 --> 26:22.450
manipulable pawns at his disposal.

26:19.950 --> 26:23.510
♪ Let me bang my head
against a brick wall ♪

26:22.590 --> 26:24.240
Treasured when needed

26:24.350 --> 26:26.390
and discarded like worn-out shoes.

26:24.500 --> 26:30.780
♪ If this is my destiny,
I'll accept it ♪

26:26.820 --> 26:27.710
In view of that,

26:28.270 --> 26:29.200
I earnestly

26:29.590 --> 26:31.030
implore Your Highness

26:31.770 --> 26:33.360
to spare Yimeng.

26:34.090 --> 26:35.200
Everything I did before

26:35.200 --> 26:36.460
was to protect myself.

26:37.080 --> 26:38.080
But in the future,

26:38.550 --> 26:40.640
I want to clear the misunderstandings between her and me

26:40.640 --> 26:42.770
and even become her lifelong partner.

26:44.030 --> 26:45.240
I also promise you

26:46.090 --> 26:47.590
that I will do everything I can

26:47.590 --> 26:48.990
to keep her safe for life.

26:49.720 --> 26:50.270
For

26:50.440 --> 26:51.790
failing my supervisory duties,

26:51.790 --> 26:53.320
trusting the wrong person,

26:53.350 --> 26:54.790
sponsoring people
from the martial arts world,

26:54.790 --> 26:56.100
withholding the truth

26:56.350 --> 26:57.480
and indulging outlaws in

26:57.480 --> 26:59.000
storming the execution ground,

26:59.000 --> 26:59.790
I now forfeit

27:00.440 --> 27:02.240
my noble title to make amends.

27:04.770 --> 27:08.190
♪ Wind, be with me
in the quest for an ideal ♪

27:09.120 --> 27:12.160
♪ Brush and ink,
stand with me on the cliff ♪

27:13.680 --> 27:19.960
♪ My heart measures
the waves I've cleaved ♪

27:17.030 --> 27:18.310
Your Majesty,

27:18.310 --> 27:19.510
60 lashes were given.

27:22.500 --> 27:25.950
♪ Setting sun, help me
weather through the big snow ♪

27:27.110 --> 27:31.150
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter
to get sorrowful ♪

27:33.840 --> 27:41.670
♪ Every word resonates with me
like dancing notes on the paper ♪

28:03.740 --> 28:04.620
Mr. Song!

28:04.750 --> 28:05.670
Mr. Song, wait.

28:12.350 --> 28:13.160
Mr. Song.

28:15.530 --> 28:17.080
That day, in the Song Residence,

28:17.080 --> 28:18.580
you gave me tips about investigating

28:18.580 --> 28:21.030
the Waning River Crescent's Nightwalkers.

28:21.030 --> 28:22.890
Now, the truth has been revealed.

28:23.070 --> 28:24.030
Why did you

28:24.030 --> 28:25.350
defend Nan Heng today?

28:26.680 --> 28:28.340
Don't take it wrong, Guihong.

28:29.310 --> 28:30.870
I said those words today

28:30.890 --> 28:33.110
only to maintain the peace of the nation.

28:33.110 --> 28:34.750
I was not partial to him.

28:35.500 --> 28:37.190
Yimeng and I got engaged
when we were little.

28:37.190 --> 28:39.790
You've been a father figure
to me for a long time.

28:39.790 --> 28:41.190
I just don't understand.

28:41.420 --> 28:42.820
Why are you and Yimeng...

28:43.740 --> 28:45.800
Why are the both of you different now?

28:45.810 --> 28:47.480
What have I done wrong?

28:51.630 --> 28:53.560
Now that we're speaking our minds,

28:54.290 --> 28:56.460
a question of mine begs your answer.

28:57.200 --> 28:58.950
Today, you insisted on
probing to the bottom

28:58.950 --> 29:01.240
of the incident on the execution ground.

29:01.260 --> 29:04.140
Did it occur to you
that Yimeng could be implicated?

29:08.790 --> 29:09.750
I know

29:09.750 --> 29:11.730
you must've been so swamped

29:11.750 --> 29:13.010
that you neglected it.

29:15.350 --> 29:17.070
But the Seventh Prince sorted out

29:17.070 --> 29:18.720
that old case within one day.

29:19.030 --> 29:21.110
He didn't have much free time either.

29:21.750 --> 29:22.770
He also declared

29:22.790 --> 29:25.940
to be solely responsible
for disrupting the execution.

29:25.960 --> 29:27.600
While he proved Chancellor Gao guilty,

29:27.600 --> 29:29.320
he managed to protect the Nightwalkers

29:29.320 --> 29:32.140
and preserve the reputation
of my two daughters.

29:32.950 --> 29:33.950
He made zero slip

29:33.970 --> 29:35.100
in the course.

29:35.420 --> 29:37.360
Do you know why he could make it?

29:41.480 --> 29:42.510
Are you implying

29:44.370 --> 29:46.170
that I'm not as competent as him?

29:46.590 --> 29:47.310
No, I'm not.

29:49.090 --> 29:50.510
The Seventh Prince

29:50.880 --> 29:52.030
only focused on the case

29:52.030 --> 29:53.760
and on defusing the situation.

29:55.310 --> 29:56.670
Whereas, you used

29:57.800 --> 29:59.120
the case as a weapon

29:59.140 --> 30:00.530
against Xuanjia Army.

30:01.640 --> 30:02.500
Different intentions

30:02.500 --> 30:04.160
led you onto different paths.

30:04.280 --> 30:05.340
Your approach

30:05.440 --> 30:08.140
would've dragged
more people into the mess.

30:08.310 --> 30:10.240
I never meant to implicate Yimeng.

30:11.030 --> 30:11.830
Today,

30:11.830 --> 30:13.090
I was being negligent.

30:13.640 --> 30:14.400
But in the future,

30:14.400 --> 30:15.930
after Nan Heng is defeated,

30:16.250 --> 30:18.340
I won't let anyone hurt Yimeng.

30:18.640 --> 30:19.350
I will also

30:19.350 --> 30:21.030
marry her and give her a perfect wedding.

30:21.030 --> 30:22.160
Her reputation

30:22.160 --> 30:23.560
will be restored as well.

30:25.830 --> 30:26.830
Guihong,

30:27.640 --> 30:28.950
you can't force

30:29.100 --> 30:30.490
a girl to love you.

30:32.730 --> 30:35.240
Yimeng has made her choice.

30:36.550 --> 30:39.170
It's time you let go.

30:40.970 --> 30:42.780
But Nan Heng and she
are no longer engaged.

30:42.780 --> 30:44.320
Why can't I pursue her?

30:45.860 --> 30:47.770
I understand

30:48.700 --> 30:50.550
all your frustrations.

30:51.770 --> 30:52.850
But Yimeng and you

30:53.510 --> 30:55.240
were through on the day your engagement

30:55.240 --> 30:56.440
was cancelled.

31:01.400 --> 31:03.590
Please, General Chu,

31:04.080 --> 31:05.310
spare Yimeng

31:06.440 --> 31:07.830
and spare yourself.

31:13.160 --> 31:20.780
[Song Residence]

31:20.880 --> 31:29.020
[Iconic Scenes in the Script]

31:26.830 --> 31:28.490
According to the script rule,

31:28.720 --> 31:31.550
all the remaining
iconic scenes will happen.

31:32.250 --> 31:34.510
Stabbing one another on the wedding day.

31:35.040 --> 31:36.510
Even if this is a mistake,

31:36.590 --> 31:38.390
it's one I'd gladly make

31:38.420 --> 31:39.490
again and again!

31:38.600 --> 31:44.270
♪ The mortal world entangles,
so much sorrow and chill in the mist ♪

31:41.190 --> 31:43.850
The classic--
choosing one of the two hostages.

31:45.150 --> 31:46.370
Being a mutilated

31:46.680 --> 31:48.220
living corpse in the cold palace.

31:47.280 --> 31:52.910
♪ Our fates intertwine and weave
into a story ♪

31:50.000 --> 31:52.600
The Song family being
slaughtered by Nan Heng.

31:55.910 --> 31:59.870
♪ Listening to the wind whispering
by my ear ♪

31:58.490 --> 32:01.720
[Slacker Escape Plan]

32:00.630 --> 32:03.630
♪ The schemes of the dark night ♪

32:00.710 --> 32:02.840
Since I came to this world,

32:03.920 --> 32:06.270
I've been doing what I consider right.

32:04.490 --> 32:08.630
♪ Eyes guarding a single sunrise ♪

32:06.920 --> 32:09.570
But is what I've seen and heard

32:08.870 --> 32:15.070
[Nan Heng]

32:09.570 --> 32:12.480
♪ When will there be a way home? ♪

32:10.070 --> 32:12.200
the so called truth?

32:13.400 --> 32:14.160
You're approaching me

32:13.950 --> 32:16.870
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

32:14.160 --> 32:15.030
only for the power

32:15.030 --> 32:16.760
of the Song family, aren't you?

32:16.830 --> 32:18.070
Do you mean I should

32:18.570 --> 32:21.890
♪ Stepping into the ranks of fate,
each pain a prelude ♪

32:18.790 --> 32:20.450
have just let you drown?

32:20.590 --> 32:21.400
Yes.

32:22.030 --> 32:22.880
Fine.

32:23.110 --> 32:26.530
♪ Transformed in a fleeting moment,
like a dream, elusive and near ♪

32:23.160 --> 32:24.620
If you get in danger again,

32:24.680 --> 32:26.980
I'll definitely not interfere.

32:27.430 --> 32:30.840
♪ How can love and hate be hidden? ♪

32:31.700 --> 32:34.840
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

32:36.380 --> 32:40.420
♪ Making all moves in life cautiously,
joy and sorrow already destined ♪

32:37.000 --> 32:38.020
I'm the one

32:38.240 --> 32:39.860
to blame for all the wrongs.

32:40.150 --> 32:41.990
Miss Song is completely innocent.

32:41.810 --> 32:45.370
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

32:42.560 --> 32:43.750
No, Your Highness!

32:45.290 --> 32:45.920
You,

32:45.950 --> 32:46.810
sleep in the bed.

32:46.410 --> 32:53.740
♪ So close yet still, we part ways ♪

32:47.820 --> 32:49.490
If you dare to wake me up again,

32:50.960 --> 32:52.310
I'll kill you.

32:53.770 --> 32:55.300
I'll say this one more time.

32:56.240 --> 32:57.030
Song Yimeng

32:57.790 --> 33:00.480
is my future wife,
who I fought very hard for.

33:01.550 --> 33:02.550
Don't offend her,

33:03.880 --> 33:05.840
or you'll regret it.

33:07.920 --> 33:09.050
About the script...

33:11.070 --> 33:12.310
and that...

33:13.630 --> 33:14.490
script rule...

33:14.720 --> 33:15.870
Let me tell you this.

33:17.200 --> 33:18.550
I'm a living person.

33:18.550 --> 33:20.200
I'm standing right here.

33:21.070 --> 33:21.960
I'm right here,

33:21.960 --> 33:23.200
but you choose to ignore me

33:23.200 --> 33:24.000
and to believe

33:24.000 --> 33:25.480
some absurd script!

33:25.480 --> 33:26.200
Yes!

33:26.590 --> 33:27.990
I don't believe you.

33:28.400 --> 33:29.520
And not just now,

33:29.720 --> 33:30.750
you have lost

33:31.300 --> 33:34.920
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

33:31.390 --> 33:33.000
my trust forever!

33:33.590 --> 33:34.940
Listen up, Nan Heng,

33:35.270 --> 33:36.650
since I started approaching you,

33:35.920 --> 33:39.380
♪ Stepping into the ranks of fate,
each pain a prelude ♪

33:36.680 --> 33:38.610
all I've ever wanted is to kill you.

33:39.160 --> 33:40.790
That was my purpose for
seeking the method of weapon forging,

33:40.790 --> 33:44.410
♪ Transformed in a fleeting moment,
like a dream, elusive and near ♪

33:40.830 --> 33:42.440
for spending
the Lantern Festival with you,

33:42.440 --> 33:44.170
and for getting engaged to you!

33:45.450 --> 33:48.800
♪ How can love and hate be hidden? ♪

33:50.310 --> 33:52.770
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

33:54.040 --> 33:57.590
♪ Making all moves in life cautiously,
joy and sorrow already destined ♪

33:59.140 --> 34:02.750
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

34:03.720 --> 34:11.120
♪ So close yet still, we part ways ♪

34:13.330 --> 34:16.630
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

34:17.880 --> 34:24.690
♪ So close yet still, we part ways ♪

34:41.440 --> 34:43.360
What a spread.

34:43.550 --> 34:45.230
Here comes the soup!

34:48.670 --> 34:49.260
Alright.

34:49.480 --> 34:50.320
It's all set.

34:50.550 --> 34:51.620
Let's eat.

34:52.960 --> 34:54.159
Whose birthday is it?

34:54.870 --> 34:57.280
Gatherings are not only for birthdays.

34:57.440 --> 34:59.230
Something just occurred to me.

35:00.210 --> 35:02.050
Since I came here,

35:02.400 --> 35:04.630
I haven't had a proper meal with you.

35:06.020 --> 35:09.060
I used to consider Dad

35:09.150 --> 35:11.010
a slick and sly bureaucrat

35:12.000 --> 35:13.010
and Yiting

35:13.110 --> 35:14.200
a naive

35:14.230 --> 35:15.970
and holier-than-thou girl.

35:16.570 --> 35:18.110
As for Madam...

35:18.840 --> 35:20.310
I thought of you as

35:20.480 --> 35:21.610
an evil stepmother.

35:22.380 --> 35:23.110
Hey, Song Yimeng...

35:23.110 --> 35:23.670
Mom!

35:23.670 --> 35:25.530
You're getting out of the line...

35:26.470 --> 35:27.840
You little brat.

35:29.190 --> 35:30.280
But after spending time with you,

35:30.280 --> 35:31.540
I've finally realized

35:32.430 --> 35:33.920
what family truly means.

35:36.630 --> 35:37.960
Dad is busy working,

35:37.960 --> 35:39.070
but he always prepares

35:39.070 --> 35:40.840
ginseng cakes for me in secret.

35:41.440 --> 35:42.630
Yiting is blunt

35:42.630 --> 35:43.560
and persistent.

35:43.630 --> 35:46.090
She always defends me
in front of outsiders.

35:47.530 --> 35:48.770
And Madam...

35:50.440 --> 35:52.700
Though we're not very close,

35:53.400 --> 35:54.360
I assume...

35:56.400 --> 35:58.590
If my mother were still alive,

35:58.670 --> 36:01.280
she'd probably take good care of me

36:01.280 --> 36:02.510
like you do of Yiting.

36:10.030 --> 36:10.880
Alright.

36:10.900 --> 36:12.030
Stop being so mushy.

36:12.070 --> 36:12.960
Save these words

36:12.960 --> 36:14.590
for your wedding day.

36:15.070 --> 36:16.550
Did you invite us here to eat

36:16.550 --> 36:18.610
or to hear these fancy lines of yours?

36:18.790 --> 36:19.720
Yiting is right.

36:19.770 --> 36:20.510
Let's eat.

36:20.590 --> 36:21.510
Enjoy the food.

36:21.550 --> 36:22.930
-Let's eat.
-Let's eat.

36:23.190 --> 36:24.000
Dad,

36:24.020 --> 36:25.220
braised pork for you.

36:25.630 --> 36:26.710
A big drumstick.

36:26.710 --> 36:27.400
Yimeng,

36:27.400 --> 36:28.400
this is for you.

36:31.930 --> 36:33.060
Thank you, Madam.

36:38.650 --> 36:39.630
Shall we have drinks?

36:39.630 --> 36:40.110
Sure.

36:40.110 --> 36:40.960
Let's drink.

36:40.960 --> 36:42.710
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

36:47.110 --> 36:48.800
Madam, let me get you some soup.

36:48.800 --> 36:49.280
Come on.

36:49.280 --> 36:49.960
Try the dishes.

36:49.960 --> 36:51.000
I was attracted by the smell just now.

36:51.000 --> 36:51.630
How lovely.

36:51.630 --> 36:52.490
Come on, Dad.

36:52.710 --> 36:53.230
Okay.

36:53.440 --> 36:54.000
Thanks.

36:54.000 --> 36:54.960
Here, Yiting.

36:54.980 --> 36:55.930
You try it too.

36:56.720 --> 36:57.940
Have some soup.

36:58.880 --> 37:00.280
Now is not the right time.

37:01.190 --> 37:02.250
Just keep waiting.

37:03.590 --> 37:04.780
Okay, Father.

37:05.030 --> 37:05.840
Actually,

37:05.840 --> 37:07.040
I don't mind waiting.

37:07.630 --> 37:08.550
After all, Heng

37:08.550 --> 37:10.360
has lost Gao Changyin's aid now.

37:10.840 --> 37:12.000
In terms of cultural administration,

37:12.000 --> 37:14.320
martial prowess
and support from officials,

37:14.320 --> 37:16.510
he is no match for me.

37:17.440 --> 37:19.240
You're talking nonsense again.

37:20.320 --> 37:21.630
It isn't time to feel complacent.

37:21.630 --> 37:22.920
We're discussing a major issue.

37:22.920 --> 37:24.720
It needs further deliberation.

37:28.960 --> 37:29.760
Your Majesty,

37:30.030 --> 37:32.280
there are 2,000 Xuanjia
soldiers at the borders.

37:32.280 --> 37:34.280
Plus those formidable Nightwalkers,

37:34.280 --> 37:36.800
Nan Heng's strength
can't be underestimated.

37:36.800 --> 37:38.280
To prevent trouble, Your Majesty

37:38.280 --> 37:40.340
must strip him of his military power.

37:43.800 --> 37:46.840
The Gao family has an intricate web
of connections in the court.

37:46.840 --> 37:48.230
Though

37:48.460 --> 37:50.140
Gao Changyin has been ousted,

37:50.410 --> 37:53.180
his remaining proteges
will still support Heng.

37:53.280 --> 37:55.210
You saw what happened in the court.

37:55.560 --> 37:56.960
Heng is still favored by

37:57.360 --> 37:59.400
many civil and military officials.

38:00.030 --> 38:02.670
If he is deprived of his military
power without a solid reason,

38:02.670 --> 38:04.580
there will be chaos in the court.

38:05.440 --> 38:06.280
I think...

38:07.400 --> 38:09.980
That sly old man Song Yude
did have a point.

38:10.590 --> 38:11.770
We need to come up

38:12.190 --> 38:14.390
with a legitimate reason.

38:20.300 --> 38:21.090
Yes.

38:22.150 --> 38:23.410
You're right, Father.

38:24.000 --> 38:24.840
But you see,

38:25.150 --> 38:26.840
Heng is very cunning.

38:26.840 --> 38:28.430
That embezzlement case
could've nailed him,

38:28.430 --> 38:30.480
but he put on an act
and helped himself out.

38:30.480 --> 38:32.810
What legitimate reason is left for us now?

38:34.280 --> 38:35.590
If there isn't one,

38:35.950 --> 38:37.300
then we can invent one.

38:38.630 --> 38:39.560
I've heard about

38:39.760 --> 38:42.980
the close kinship between
Chancellor Gao and the Noble Consort.

38:42.980 --> 38:45.230
Nan Heng cares a lot
about his family, doesn't he?

38:45.230 --> 38:47.000
We can bring him to heel

38:47.020 --> 38:48.820
by attacking the Noble Consort.

38:58.190 --> 38:59.000
Your Majesty,

38:59.480 --> 39:01.230
the court is like a battlefield.

39:01.230 --> 39:02.670
Every opportunity is precious.

39:02.670 --> 39:04.800
Missing out on one will cost us dearly.

39:08.110 --> 39:10.240
Your Majesty, please don't hesitate.

39:10.670 --> 39:11.060
[Memorial]

39:20.630 --> 39:21.690
What are you doing?

39:21.840 --> 39:22.920
Chancellor Gao is asking

39:22.920 --> 39:24.360
for a meeting with the Seventh Prince.

39:24.360 --> 39:25.320
No way.

39:25.440 --> 39:26.360
It's just a meeting.

39:26.360 --> 39:27.520
How many times have I told you?

39:27.520 --> 39:28.190
What are you doing?

39:28.190 --> 39:29.110
What's wrong with you?

39:29.110 --> 39:30.050
I already said no!

39:30.050 --> 39:30.910
Get out of here!

39:47.400 --> 39:48.190
Fugui.

39:50.590 --> 39:51.290
Fugui!

39:56.510 --> 39:57.280
Your Highness...

39:57.280 --> 39:57.840
No.

39:57.840 --> 39:58.480
General,

39:58.480 --> 39:59.510
you only rested for a moment.

39:59.510 --> 40:00.710
Why are you up so soon?

40:01.110 --> 40:02.640
What's happening outside?

40:02.800 --> 40:04.110
It's about Chancellor Gao.

40:04.110 --> 40:05.280
He's asking in the imperial prison

40:05.280 --> 40:06.560
for a meeting with you.

40:11.400 --> 40:12.870
I'd rather not.

40:13.630 --> 40:15.190
But he is my uncle after all.

40:16.280 --> 40:17.710
Just ensure he'll suffer less

40:17.710 --> 40:18.710
when he is exiled.

40:19.480 --> 40:21.070
Make proper arrangements for him.

40:21.070 --> 40:21.590
Got it.

40:24.280 --> 40:25.480
Go get prepared.

40:26.280 --> 40:27.300
I'm heading out.

40:27.440 --> 40:28.230
Now?

40:28.470 --> 40:29.070
But your injuries...

40:29.070 --> 40:29.730
Do as I said.

40:32.030 --> 40:32.670
Yes.
